# Integration / runtime-dependent test patterns (ctest -R/-E regex, matched
# against "Suite.Test" names). These need a real runtime that the plain unit
# CI does not provide — an external gRPC server, a ROS graph, multi-participant
# DDS discovery timing, or a docker container — so they are split out of the
# unit lane (run_unittest.sh excludes them) and run in a separate integration
# lane (run_integration.sh runs only them), mirroring the HMI ci.yml split of
# unit-test vs integration vs ros-e2e jobs.
#
# Keep this as ONE extended-regex on a single logical line (comments/blank
# lines are stripped by the runners). Add new integration tests here.
#
# ── whole integration suites ──────────────────────────────────────────────
#  GrpcTransportTest            : opens a real gRPC channel to localhost:5443
#  ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest / LifecycleAdswIntegrationTest : real DDS pub→sub
#  *AutowareE2ETest / L3AutowareE2ETest : real autoware docker container
# ── specific runtime/flaky tests inside otherwise-unit suites ──────────────
#  MessageTransmitterTest .*ROS : ROS-forwarding paths need a ROS graph
#  DDSProtocolTest .*_with_(reader|writer) : 실 DDS DataReader/DataWriter 생성·해제
#                                 (UnsubscribeMessage_TC003_with_reader 등은 단위
#                                  환경에서 90s timeout/hang), + 특정 xcdr 직렬화 케이스
#  GrpcProviderTest (whole)     : background subscribe/set worker-thread timing
#                                 (SetValueSuccess / SubscribeFailsWithErrorResponse
#                                  flake across runs) — gRPC stub is mocked but the
#                                  provider drives a worker thread.
#  VssSubscriptionManagerTest.SubscriptionWithPathsFilter : period-timer timing
#  OtamActorServiceTest.F012_.. : actor signal/timeout thread timing
GrpcTransportTest\.|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.|LifecycleAdswIntegrationTest\.|Autoware.*E2ETest\.|L3AutowareE2ETest\.|MessageTransmitterTest\..*ROS|DDSProtocolTest\..*_with_(reader|writer)|DDSProtocolDeserializeTest\.Deserialize_Direct_TC016_sequence_string|DDSProtocolBranchCoverageTest\.register_type_object_TC003_comprehensive_sequence|GrpcProviderTest\.|VssSubscriptionManagerTest\.SubscriptionWithPathsFilter|OtamActorServiceTest\.F012_AllSignalsBeforeTimeout_NoTimeout
